What this licence covers, and what it does not

Covered. The register annotation, the codebook, the provenance records and the
aggregated result tables. These are original work: they are judgements about
the text, and statistics computed from it, rather than the text itself.

Not covered, and not distributed. The dialogue of the five games. The
annotation refers to it by game, sequence number and a truncated hash, and
carries no dialogue text. Reconstructing the full corpus requires your own
copies of the source transcripts, which belong to the individuals who produced
them, and reproduces dialogue that belongs to the rights holders of the games.
